Requester Interface
→ Emergency Request Backend
→ Random Voice Challenge
→ Audio Recording
→ Aletheia + Eidos
→ Risk Assessment
→ Action-Bound Approval Service
→ Separate Approver Device
→ Backend Approval Validation
